{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t5V4pMheiA1794536821.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>微軟出現系統故障，影響電郵等服務，至少十多萬用戶報告受影響。</p><p></p><p>服務中斷網站DOWNDETECTOR的數據顯示，近13萬名用戶在本港時間凌晨2時，回報無法登入微軟電郵軟件OUTLOOK，另外亦有收到微軟其他應用程式，無法運作的問題。微軟稱是由於部分伺服器突然未能正常運作，目前已局部修復北美地區服務，稱故障將影響其他地區的服務，會調查故障原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:54:25.799411+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:57:11.407591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:47:47.156157+00:00","content_hash":"7e1c06832341dc426da7f86687741d0dd175d9446c49e01c61f37886323b0567","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:54:25.799411+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}